"""
LANTIVO — CANIBALIZATION EQUIVALENCE GATE V1 — SNAPSHOT PREPARE

READ-ONLY against every authoritative remote source.
LOCAL writes are limited to the chosen --out-dir.

Preferred mode (local-certified): reconstructs the ACTIVE immutable C2 Radar base
without re-downloading ~20k cells, using the exact historical source staging plus
41 C2 candidate cells that were authenticated during C2 APPLY. Every local source
cell is re-hashed against the historical checkpoint DB; all 41 candidates are
re-hashed against the frozen C2 inventory. Public manifest + _SUCCESS + identity
sidecar are GET-verified so the reconstruction is tied to the active data plane.

Fallback mode (public-snapshot): GETs the active public cells checkpointed/resumable.
It still needs a trusted cell keyset from the historical source staging/checkpoint
or --cell-list. No remote write method exists in this script.
"""
